---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Contact Us - Finsiva" description="Contact Finsiva for inquiries, feedback, or suggestions about our tax calculators and platform.">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-canvas dark:bg-canvas">
    <main class="min-h-screen">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-8 dark:text-on-primary">Contact Us</h1>

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224154-26032ffc0d07?w=1200&q=80" alt="Modern office contact desk" class="mb-6 w-full rounded-lg object-cover max-h-80 sm:max-h-96" loading="lazy" />

        <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-6 text-body dark:text-muted">
          <p>We value your feedback and inquiries. Whether you have a question, suggestion, or need assistance, please reach out to us.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Get in Touch</h2>
          <p>For general inquiries, feedback, or suggestions about Finsiva, please contact us through the following channels. We aim to respond to all messages within two business days, though response times may vary during tax season or after major product launches.</p>

          <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Email</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted"><a href="mailto:ornacasa11@gmail.com" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">ornacasa11@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted">Use this address for general questions, feature requests, or partnership inquiries. Please include your country and the type of tax scenario you are interested in so we can route your message to the right specialist. We respond to all emails within two business days during normal operations.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Support</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">support@finsiva.com</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted">For technical issues with calculators, broken links, or accessibility problems, please use our dedicated support address. Our engineering team monitors this inbox and prioritizes bugs that affect calculation accuracy or site functionality. If you notice a discrepancy between our results and official tax authority figures, please include both values and the jurisdiction so we can investigate promptly.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Press and Media</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">media@finsiva.com</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted">Journalists and analysts covering personal finance, tax technology, or regulatory compliance are welcome to request data, interviews, or background information. We can provide aggregate usage statistics, commentary on tax policy changes, and screenshots for publication. We ask that media inquiries include publication name, deadline, and a brief description of the story angle.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Social Media</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">Follow us for updates on new calculators, tax tips, and policy changes.</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted">
              <li><a href="https://twitter.com/finsiva" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Twitter / X</a> — Announcements and quick tips</li>
              <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/company/finsiva" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">LinkedIn</a> — Professional updates and career content</li>
              <li><a href="https://youtube.com/@finsiva" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">YouTube</a> — Video guides and calculator walkthroughs</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Support Channels</h2>
          <p>We offer several channels depending on the nature of your request. For immediate help with a calculator, try our in-app help text or check the Knowledge Center. For detailed policy questions, email is preferred because it allows us to include references and examples. We do not currently offer live chat or phone support, but we evaluate new channels based on user demand and resource availability.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-body dark:text-muted">If you reach out and do not receive a response, please check your spam folder. Our emails sometimes land there for new senders. You can also resend your message after one week with a brief note indicating it is a follow-up. During peak periods, such as tax season or after a major feature launch, response times may be slightly longer than usual.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-body dark:text-muted">For users in time zones significantly different from our primary support hours, please allow extra time for a reply. We serve a global audience and strive to cover major business hours in North America, Europe, and Asia-Pacific, but our team is distributed and coverage varies by day.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Partnerships</h2>
          <p>If you are interested in partnering with Finsiva or have business inquiries, please reach out with your proposal. We are open to collaborations with financial educators, accounting firms, government agencies, and technology platforms that share our mission of making tax information more accessible. You can also learn more about our mission on the <a href="/about" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">About</a> page.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-body dark:text-muted">When submitting a partnership proposal, please describe your organization, the proposed collaboration, and the expected timeline. We review all proposals within five business days and will follow up if there is a mutual fit. We are particularly interested in partnerships that expand access to underserved regions, improve financial literacy, or integrate tax education into existing platforms.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Feedback</h2>
          <p>We welcome your suggestions for new calculators, countries, or features. Your input helps us improve Finsiva for everyone.</p>
          <p>When submitting feedback, please include your country and the type of tax scenario you are interested in. Our team typically responds within 2–3 business days. The more detail you provide about your use case, the faster we can assess whether we can support it.</p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Send a Message</h2>
          <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xpqvelrz" method="POST" class="space-y-4">
            <div>
              <label for="contact-name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1 dark:text-on-primary">Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="contact-name" name="name" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas px-4 py-2 text-ink focus:border-primary focus:outline-none dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:text-on-primary" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="contact-email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1 dark:text-on-primary">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="contact-email" name="email" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas px-4 py-2 text-ink focus:border-primary focus:outline-none dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:text-on-primary" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="contact-subject" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1 dark:text-on-primary">Subject</label>
              <input type="text" id="contact-subject" name="subject" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas px-4 py-2 text-ink focus:border-primary focus:outline-none dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:text-on-primary" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="contact-message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1 dark:text-on-primary">Message</label>
              <textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="4" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas px-4 py-2 text-ink focus:border-primary focus:outline-none dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:text-on-primary"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send Message</button>
          </form>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Quick Links</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/countries" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Browse Country Tax Information</a></li>
            <li><a href="/blogs" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Read Tax Blog Articles</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Learn About Finsiva</a></li>
            <li><a href="/knowledge" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Tax Knowledge Center</a></li>
            <li><a href="/privacy" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/terms" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Terms of Service</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>